# Keeps the build context small and fast, and keeps things that don't
# belong in an image layer (a real config, a real local db, a stale local
# frontend build) out of it entirely (issue #39). internal/webui/dist is
# excluded even though it's needed at build time -- the Dockerfile's own
# web stage rebuilds it fresh from web/'s source inside the image, so a
# possibly-stale local build must never be silently copied in instead.
.git
web/node_modules
internal/webui/dist
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
config.json
/spidercob
